title: 'Paradigm Self-Insurance: The System That Checks Itself'
summary: Paradigm now eats its own cooking. A 7-check integrity system validates broken references, duplicate symbols, orphaned symbols, missing anchors, out-of-bounds anchors, component anchor health, and .purpose file bloat — wired into reindex, postflight, doctor, status, stop hook, and a new CLI command. Every quality gap that could slip through silently is now surfaced automatically.
